                                                        <div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">So the cali crew is finally up and running. We&#039;re still very low level but soon this world will cower at our feet! muhahaha!<span style="color: Red;"></span>. He are all humans (blah) so look for &quot;Kakatal, Vain or Neroon&quot;. It&#039;s truly a dark day for wow.</div>
