                                        <tr>
                                                <td valign="top" width="16%" rowspan="2" style="overflow: hidden;">
                                                        <b><a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=9" title="View the profile of Kaed">Kaed</a></b>
                                                        <div class="smalltext">
                                                                Officer<br />
                                                                Broodling<br />
                                                                <img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
                                                                Posts: 44<br />
                                                                <br />
                                                                <div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;"><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=dlattach;id=3;type=avatar" alt="" /></div><br />
                                                                Why HERRO!<br />
                                                                <br />
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <br />
                                                                <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=9"><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
                                                        </div>
                                                </td>
                                                <td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
                                                        <table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
                                                                <td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=292.msg1732#msg1732"><img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
                                                                <td align="left" valign="middle">
                                                                        <b><a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=292.msg1732#msg1732">Re: West Side Crew is here!</a></b>
                                                                        <div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> January 12, 2005, 05:23:36 pm &#187;</div></td>
                                                                <td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
                                                                </td>
                                                        </tr></table>
                                                        <hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
                                                        <div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">What up! I&#039;ll be in tonight to give ya&#039;s some lewts to get you started. Dark days indeed... welcome home boys. Looking forward to doing some hackety-huh-hack with ya. </div>
                                                </td>
