                                                                        <img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Themes/dark/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" />
                                                                        Logged
                                                                </td>
                                                        </tr></table>
                                                        <hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
                                                        <div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 3px;" class="signature"><i>It is by will alone I set my mind in motion.<br />It is by the juice of Sappho that thoughts acquire speed,<br />the lips acquire stains, the stains become a warning.<br />It is by will alone I set my mind in motion.</i><br /><br /><a href="http://wow.allakhazam.com/profile.html?11568" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Kaed</span></a></div>
